							For we are out to empower young cameroonians with skills to fit the demands of the African tech system.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<!--Second item-->
				<div class="carousel-height relative float-left -mr-[100%] hidden w-full transition-transform duration-[600ms] ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none"
